#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:83
msgid ""
"Log forwarding traffic flows directly from managed hosts to the syslog "
"receiver. Ensure all managed hosts have network access to the syslog "
"destination — not just the |morpheus| appliance."
msgstr ""
"O tráfego de encaminhamento de logs flui diretamente dos hosts gerenciados "
"para o receptor syslog. Certifique-se de que todos os hosts gerenciados "
"tenham acesso de rede ao destino syslog — não apenas o appliance |morpheus|."

