msgstr "Logs do hypervisor HVM (kernel, libvirt, agent)"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:96
msgid "Appliance Service Logs"
msgstr "Logs de Serviço do Appliance"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:98
msgid ""
"Appliance-level service logs (MySQL, RabbitMQ, OpenSearch, Nginx, "
"application logs) are **not** forwarded by the Agent-based syslog rules. "
"To forward appliance logs, configure syslog forwarding at the OS level "
"using ``rsyslog`` or ``syslog-ng`` on the appliance host, or use the "
"logback SIEM appender configuration. See :doc:`appliance_logs` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Os logs de serviço no nível do appliance (MySQL, RabbitMQ, OpenSearch, Nginx, "
"logs de aplicação) **não** são encaminhados pelas regras syslog baseadas no "
"Agente. Para encaminhar logs do appliance, configure o encaminhamento syslog "
"no nível do SO usando ``rsyslog`` ou ``syslog-ng`` no host do appliance, ou "
"use a configuração do appender SIEM do logback. Consulte :doc:`appliance_logs` "
"para detalhes."

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:101
msgid "Integration with SIEM Platforms"
msgstr "Integração com Plataformas SIEM"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:103
msgid ""
"For SIEM integration (CEF/LEEF format, structured audit events), "
"|morpheus| supports a logback-based audit appender that can write "
"directly to SIEM databases or syslog endpoints in Common Event Format. "
"This is configured at the appliance level rather than through the UI "
"forwarding rules. See the CEF/SIEM Auditing section in "
":doc:`appliance_logs`."
msgstr ""
"Para integração com SIEM (formato CEF/LEEF, eventos de auditoria estruturados), "
"|morpheus| suporta um appender de auditoria baseado em logback que pode gravar "
"diretamente em bancos de dados SIEM ou endpoints syslog no Common Event Format. "
"Isso é configurado no nível do appliance e não através das regras de "
"encaminhamento da UI. Consulte a seção CEF/SIEM Auditing em "
":doc:`appliance_logs`."

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:106
msgid "Troubleshooting Log Forwarding"
msgstr "Solução de Problemas do Encaminhamento de Logs"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:108
msgid "**Logs not appearing at the destination:**"
msgstr "**Logs não aparecem no destino:**"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:110
msgid ""
"Verify network connectivity from a managed host to the syslog receiver on"
" the configured port"
msgstr ""
"Verifique a conectividade de rede de um host gerenciado para o receptor "
"syslog na porta configurada"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:111
msgid ""
"Confirm the |morpheus| Agent is running on the host (``systemctl status "
"morpheus-node-agent``)"
msgstr ""
"Confirme que o Agente |morpheus| está em execução no host (``systemctl status "
"morpheus-node-agent``)"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:112
msgid ""
"Check that the forwarding rule protocol matches what the receiver expects"
" (UDP vs TCP vs TLS)"
msgstr ""
"Verifique se o protocolo da regra de encaminhamento corresponde ao que o "
"receptor espera (UDP vs TCP vs TLS)"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:113
msgid ""
"Verify no firewall is blocking the syslog port between managed hosts and "
"the receiver"
msgstr ""
"Verifique se nenhum firewall está bloqueando a porta syslog entre os hosts "
"gerenciados e o receptor"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:115
msgid "**Partial logs forwarded:**"
msgstr "**Logs parcialmente encaminhados:**"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:117
msgid ""
"Only files matching ``.log`` extension in watched directories are "
"forwarded"
msgstr ""
"Apenas arquivos com extensão ``.log`` nos diretórios monitorados são "
"encaminhados"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:118
msgid ""
"Custom application logs require the LOG FOLDER to be configured on the "
"Library Node Type"
msgstr ""
"Logs de aplicação personalizados requerem que a pasta de LOG esteja "
"configurada no Library Node Type"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:119
msgid "Binary log files or files with non-standard extensions are not forwarded"
msgstr "Arquivos de log binários ou arquivos com extensões não padrão não são encaminhados"
